---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="A little more about Andrew Dobrow, his work, and his projects." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">More about me</div>
        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>A little background on the person behind the posts.</p>
      </header>
      <article class="prose">
        <p>I'm Andrew Dobrow, a dad, writer, publisher, and builder based on Florida's Treasure Coast.</p>
        <p>I've been writing on the internet for most of my adult life. For years, that meant WordPress and other hosted platforms. This site is my way of having a little place that I can shape myself, without algorithms deciding what matters.</p>
        <p>My work has taken me through sales, operations, notary services, and building digital products. These days I'm especially invested in <a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a>, the independent local news site I launched in June 2026.</p>
        <p>I don't promise to write on a schedule. I do hope to keep using this space to document the work, the setbacks, the small victories, and whatever else feels worth putting into words.</p>
        <h2>Things I've built or worked on</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a> — local news for Florida's Treasure Coast</li>
          <li><a href="https://treasurecoastnotaryservice.com/">Treasure Coast Notary Service</a> — a mobile notary business serving Martin County.</li>
          <li><a href="https://comingattractions.app/">Coming Attractions</a> — a silly little movie and TV discovery tool. The cure for streaming decision paralysis.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Find me elsewhere</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewdobrow/">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://instagram.com/andrewdobrow" rel="me">Instagram</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can also see <a href="/now/">what I'm up to right now</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
